    "extractionDate": "2026-05-23",
    "extractionMethod": "Data-only extraction of MONTH_STARTS array via `npm pack` (NO `npm install`, NO runtime dependency, NO package.json modification). Per-year month-lengths derived from consecutive MONTH_STARTS deltas; yearStart Gregorian via package's hijriToGregorian({y,1,1}).",
    "extractedRangeReason": "Range 1356-1500 AH selected because the Saudi Umm al-Qura calendar was formally adopted in 1356 AH (1937 CE). The source package covers 1343-1500 AH but years 1343-1355 fall outside the official Umm al-Qura era and are intentionally excluded from this project.",
    "auditReports": [
      "reports/hijri-umm-al-qura-data-source-audit-1.md",
      "reports/hijri-umm-al-qura-data-source-pack-audit-1.md",
      "reports/hijri-umm-al-qura-data-stage-a1-closure.md"
    ]
